 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Inspection Date: 14-July-2023",
   "text": "Inspection Time: 4:10 PM to 4:55 PM Inspection Location: Fawnbrook Lane, Littleton, CO"
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "Road Test: Yes, approximately 4 miles of mostly city roads, with a small stretch of 4 lane road, where a top speed of approximately 55 MPH was quickly, but briefly, achieved."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test Summary:",
   "text": "The 4Runner with just under 56K miles, started easily and idled fine for over 15 minutes while the engine error codes and mechanical systems were checked. No DTC codes were present. Inspector found acceleration to be very strong and shifting was remarkably smooth. The suspension was comfortable on Denver’s somewhat rough streets. The chassis overall felt extremely tight, and there were no odd rattles or sounds. Steering was great. The braking was strong and true – no pulling to either side."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior Summary:",
   "text": "The paint is in quite good condition but there are minor scratches across most of the vehicle. Inspector captured a good representation of those with a picture of the hood. Additionally if one looks very carefully at just the right angle you will see widespread minor hail damage. If one is not looking for hail damage, you would never see it."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior Summary:",
   "text": "The interior is clean, orderly and in good condition. There are no tears, rips or stains in the leather seating surfaces and that seating is clean."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "All dash and trim materials remain in good condition, better than mileage and model year would typically show."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical Summary:",
   "text": "The Firestone tires come in with 10/32nds of remaining tread. All tires are in good condition. The wheels are in great condition."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "The fluids all appear in good condition and nothing of concern appeared from close inspection of those fluids."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "Virtually all electronic accessories tested were working appropriately - including exterior lights, turn signals, reading lights, radio/nav/clock etc."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "The following items all worked as would be expected - wipers, washers, A/C, heat, window lifts, electric locks, key fob (two key fobs). Owners manuals are in the glove compartment."
  }
 ],
